//     arithmetic (no state +/- idx<'i'>(1)).
//   - Zip those views in a single traverser to give the compiler a simple
//     inner loop over contiguous memory, improving vectorization.
//   - Hoist constant weight into a single variable.
//   - Keep time-stepping sequential and purely in noarr::traverser, so
//     dependencies between timesteps are preserved exactly.
